				</div>
				<div class="process-step card">
					<h3>We Work With Your Insurance</h3>
					<p>We handle direct billing with most major carriers so you don't have to chase paperwork.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="process-step card">
					<h3>Flawless Finish</h3>
					<p>Drive away with factory-quality results. Your paint stays original, your value stays intact.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="inline-cta-strip">
				<h3>Ready to get started? It only takes 30 seconds.</h3>
				<p>Tell us about the damage or snap a few photos — we'll get back to you with a quote same day.</p>
				<div class="button-row" style="justify-content:center;">
					<a class="button primary" href="/contact">Get My Quick Quote</a>
					<a class="button ghost" href="tel:18554255336">📞 Call 1-855-425-5336</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section alt">
		<div class="container">
			<span class="section-label">Our Work</span>
			<h2>Before &amp; after paintless dent repair results</h2>
