			<div class="inline-cta-strip">
				<h3>Like what you see? Get your vehicle restored too.</h3>
				<p>Results like these are what we deliver for every customer — hail damage, door dings, and more.</p>
				<div class="button-row" style="justify-content:center;">
					<a class="button primary" href="/contact">Get a Free Estimate</a>
					<a class="button ghost" href="mailto:alldentpdr@gmail.com?subject=Dent Photo Quote Request&body=Please attach photos of your vehicle damage and include your name and phone number.">Upload Dent Photos</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="container">
			<span class="section-label">Why All Dent PDR</span>
			<h2>We're local. We're accountable. We restore — not just repair.</h2>
			<p>Every summer, storm chasers roll into Northeast Ohio making big promises and bigger free offers. Then they're gone. All Dent PDR is different — we live here, we work here, and our reputation is built on the quality of every car that leaves our shop.</p>
			<div class="grid-3" style="margin-top:36px;">
				<article class="card">
					<h3>Not a storm chaser — a local shop</h3>
					<p>We're rooted in Northeast Ohio. Our shop at 7695 Granger Rd has served this community for years and we'll still be here long after any storm has passed. When you have a question six months from now, you can call us.</p>
				</article>
				<article class="card">
					<h3>Perfection, not just completion</h3>
					<p>We don't just pull dents and move on. Every repair goes through a final inspection under LED lighting before we call you. If it's not factory-perfect, it doesn't leave our shop. Period.</p>
				</article>
				<article class="card">
					<h3>Honest work over free gimmicks</h3>
					<p>Storm chasers lead with free lunches, free rentals, and inflated claims to win your business. We lead with craftsmanship. Our reputation is the only thing we're selling — and it speaks for itself.</p>
				</article>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section alt">
		<div class="container">
			<span class="section-label">Testimonials</span>
			<h2>What our customers say</h2>
			<p>Real feedback from drivers and dealerships who trust All Dent PDR.</p>
			<div class="testimonial-grid">
				<blockquote class="testimonial-card">
					<div class="testimonial-stars">★★★★★</div>
					<p class="testimonial-text">"AllDent came out after a massive hail storm and fixed every dent on my truck. You can't even tell it was damaged. They saved me thousands compared to a body shop."</p>
